 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nMumbai Engineering Works Pvt                         MASTER SERVICES\nLtd                                                  AGREEMENT\n22 MG Road, 600001 Chennai, India\nGSTIN: 82AAACG7717A1Z2\n\nFROM                                                     BILL TO\n\nMumbai Engineering Works Pvt Ltd                        Ganga Pharma Ltd\n22 MG Road                                              22 MG Road\n600001 Chennai                                          400001 Mumbai\nIndia                                                   India\nVAT: 82AAACG7717A1Z2\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 06-02-2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Mumbai Engineering Works Pvt Ltd, with its registered office at 22 MG Road, Chennai (\"Party A\"), and Ganga\nPharma Ltd, with its registered office at 22 MG Road, Mumbai (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A     Mumbai Engineering Works Pvt Ltd / Rahul Verma\nParty B     Ganga Pharma Ltd / Rahul Verma\nDate        06-02-2026",
